.TH YMLCHECK 1 "2026-03-31" "v0.0.1" "HA Bash Menu"
.SH NAME
ymlcheck \- validate YAML theme files and configurations for HA Bash Menu
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B python3 ymlcheck.py
.I <path_to_theme.yaml>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ymlcheck.py
is a command-line utility for validating YAML theme and configuration files.
It verifies YAML syntax, schema structure, color depth mode mappings
(256, 16, 8, truecolor), color index bounds, and curses color constants.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I <path_to_theme.yaml>
Path to the YAML file to validate (e.g., bashmenu.themes).
.SH DIAGNOSTICS
.B ymlcheck.py
prints detailed error messages including line numbers, column numbers,
and context snippets if syntax or structural errors are found.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
File is valid.
.TP
.B 1
Validation failed due to syntax errors or invalid theme values.
.SH EXAMPLES
Validate the default themes file:
.RS
.B python3 ymlcheck.py bashmenu.themes
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR bashmenu (1)
